<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset OTP - MicroCart</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 32px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444 0%, #dc2626 100%);
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        .logo span { color: #fca5a5; }
        .content {
            padding: 50px 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        
        .otp-box {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 2px dashed #fca5a5;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            max-width: 280px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .otp-code {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #dc2626;
            font-family: monospace;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .timer-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #ef4444;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .help-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <!-- Premium CSS Logo -->
                <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">
                    <div style="display: inline-block; width: 64px; height: 64px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); position: relative; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 34px; vertical-align: middle;">🛍️</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;">
                    Micro<span style="color: #fca5a5;">Cart</span><span style="color: #fbbf24;">.</span>
                </div>
                <h1>Reset Your Password Request 🔑</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
                <p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to proceed. Do not share this code with anyone.</p>
                
                <div class="otp-box">
                    <p class="otp-code">{{otp}}</p>
                    <div class="timer-text">⏱️ This code is valid for exactly 2 minutes.</div>
                </div>

                <p class="help-text">If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact support immediately.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; 2026 MicroCart Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Security & Safety Team.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
